OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Scotland-England border  
OL,4,Alandmark star ever shine?              
OL,6,FA journey that started about a quarter 
OL,7,Fof a century ago has been hit by a huge
OL,8,Fsetback - just when it looked to be    
OL,9,Fnearing its destination.               
OL,11,FEverything appeared to be in place for 
OL,12,Fthe Star of Caledonia landmark artwork 
OL,13,Fto finally be built near Gretna Green. 
OL,15,FThen a major funder withdrew from the  
OL,16,Fproject at the Scotland-England border 
OL,17,Fleaving the project needing to find #8m
OL,18,Fin order to proceed.                   
